WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
On I go, searching for...

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
The past that was stolen from me

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Wandering on through...

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
This city, so strange to see

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Choked by the scent of flames that seems to...

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Cling to me

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Didn't we both say our goodbyes...

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
And go our separate ways?

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
When you see the face of hell...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
It will squeeze your heart dry

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Fighting on seems so pointless now

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
If this must be my fate...

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Then I'll make my mind up now

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
So, please, won't you just leave me be...

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Another day

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Oh, will tomorrow hold something new to see?

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.080
This is the third time we've fought.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.580
Chirico! I thought it was you!

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.920
You're a Perfect Soldier, too?!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.210
Yes. A Perfect Soldier,
more powerful than any human!

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:53.920
A chosen warrior.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.460
Proto One was also to join me
on this glorious path.

00:01:56.460 --> 00:01:59.330
But you were the one who confused her, Chirico!

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.130
Is she in Kummen, too?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.750
I owe you no answers!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.420
I'll try to find her.

00:02:18.420 --> 00:02:21.080
Then we have no choice. Face me.

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:22.750
Learn the true limits of your body!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:35.250
Reunion

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.630
Chirico! I wanted to show her your death!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.420
To Proto One!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:03.920
Mission complete. We're returning to base.

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.880
Sir, Chirico hasn't come back yet.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.330
We can't leave him behind!

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:11.210
He was crazy enough to take on
an enemy AT naked. He isn't coming back.

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:12.670
I'm going after him.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:13.630
No, you aren't!

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.130
The mission's complete.
One casualty is too many.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.710
That's irresponsible.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.540
We don't know for sure if he's dead or not.

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:21.540
I'm going.

00:04:21.880 --> 00:04:23.920
Are you disobeying my orders?!

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:30.210
I'm in command. Disobey my orders
and I'll execute you right here!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:37.750
Understood, sir...

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:51.750
Too bad I couldn't bring home a souvenir.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:52.880
Damn you, Chirico!

00:05:05.540 --> 00:05:08.000
What? You mean Chirico's...?!

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.290
He's just disappeared.

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:13.130
Without an AT, even Chirico couldn't survive.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.210
Nah, he can't be dead.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:17.210
He's always been damn near immortal.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.330
I'm praying you're right.

00:05:19.330 --> 00:05:23.170
But he had a nasty opponent.
That blue AT we've heard about.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.960
So the guys who abandoned him got back safe

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:30.290
and sit around drinking
like they couldn't care less!

00:05:32.250 --> 00:05:35.290
It ain't like we wanted to leave the guy behind!

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:40.960
I wonder if he really is dead.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.790
Yeah, I was thinking the same thing.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:46.630
Hell, no use worryin' about him!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:49.460
To me, he's just a rival who got out of the game.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.750
Just kiddin'.

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:57.420
C'mon, he used to be a Red Shoulder!
You can't kill one of those guys.

00:05:58.630 --> 00:06:00.000
I liked him.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:04.290
If Chirico hadn't acted, Monica would be dead.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.290
I lost a good scrappin' partner.

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.420
Gonna be lonely.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.460
I don't believe it! Chirico can't be dead!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:21.750
It's okay. I'll stay with you

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:26.330
I know she's coming back, but I don't mind

00:06:26.540 --> 00:06:31.130
It's okay, baby

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:34.460
I guess I'm just used to it now

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:38.330
You never seem to...

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:06.880
You've beaten me.
I'm no match, Your Highness.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:09.710
No. You've shown great improvement.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.380
Even Ypsilon would have difficulty beating me.

00:08:12.710 --> 00:08:14.630
Thank you, Highness.

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:32.420
Mr. Borough is waiting for you in the great hall.

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.460
Ah, Ypsilon. You've returned.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:44.540
And what is the situation?

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.790
Zonmu village has been destroyed.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:51.330
If we'd gotten our intelligence sooner,
we could have kept the enemy ATs out of it.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.210
I'm sorry, sir.

00:08:52.380 --> 00:08:54.670
Reinforce Garamo village!

00:08:54.670 --> 00:08:57.750
We escorted the surviving guerillas
until this morning.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:09:01.170
The Assemble base mercenaries
have been getting more active.

00:09:01.170 --> 00:09:04.960
Yes. Mr. Borough, that AT
was being piloted by Chirico.

00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:07.040
I thought as much!

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:10.290
I almost had him, but he got away.

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.380
You're a Perfect Soldier!

00:09:12.380 --> 00:09:14.210
You have nothing to fear from him!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.210
I'm not afraid of him.

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:20.540
But Proto One still carries
her memories of him, correct?

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.210
We'll erase them!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.290
Excuse me.

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:29.380
Prince Kanjelman asked if
we'd join him for his meal.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:32.330
He's in a good mood.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:35.420
Go, both of you. He'll enjoy it, I'm sure.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.130
Yes, sir.

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.000
This'll be fine.

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.250
We still haven't reached the village.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.250
That's all right.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.880
Thanks for your help. Just pull up to the bank.

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:55.830
Well, in that case...

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:03.750
When my father and brother abandoned
the ideals of King Branjelman the first,

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:07.750
so they could industrialize, they put
this land on a path towards destruction.

00:10:08.290 --> 00:10:10.630
Van Nu, the god our people
believe most fervently in,

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.630
is the great god of the earth's fertility.

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:14.790
I turned against my father and brother

00:10:14.790 --> 00:10:18.540
and declared this holy war to preserve
our Holy Kingdom of Kummen.

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:21.750
By Van Nu's grace, I continue to fight on.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:28.250
You both are my most valued of guardians,
sent by Van Nu to aid us.

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:32.920
We are honored by your grand words.

00:10:32.920 --> 00:10:35.880
As your chosen warriors,
we pledge our loyalty.

00:10:36.630 --> 00:10:38.830
I believe in you, Ypsilon.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.540
Phantom, may we always remain close allies.

00:10:42.920 --> 00:10:43.960
Yes, Highness.

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:11.460
Damn!

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:33.790
This man, you say?

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.210
He's as skilled as Ypsilon is?

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:40.170
He's Chirico Cuvie,
formerly a Melkian Armored Trooper.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.790
Now one of Gon Nu's lackeys.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:46.170
A fearless man, to have
crept into the Holy Kingdom.

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.250
What shall we do with him, Borough?

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:50.380
I'm thinking about it.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.750
Now then...

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:54.630
You killed everyone in Zonmu!

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:55.500
Execute him!

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:56.670
Yeah, kill him!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.960
Rip him apart!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.880
Silence!

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.630
Prince Kanjelman,
why not let Ypsilon handle this?

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.830
If he is a worthy opponent, then...

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:10.960
Very well.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.540
Ypsilon, I leave him to you.

00:13:13.540 --> 00:13:14.540
Yes, Highness.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.790
And what do you think, Phantom?

00:13:16.790 --> 00:13:18.750
You're familiar with him, aren't you?

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:25.580
He's caused so much trouble, he should
suffer forever in the palace dungeon.

00:13:26.790 --> 00:13:28.750
Yes, we could do that.

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.040
But I much prefer a balancing duel with lances.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.540
At least that is merciful for a warrior like him.

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.460
Yes, that will do nicely.

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:42.330
Balancing it shall be! Prepare the lances.

00:13:42.330 --> 00:13:43.330
Yes, sir!

00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.210
Chirico, you may not be familiar with balancing,

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:06.080
but it is a traditional and
holy martial art in Kummen.

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:09.750
Rules are unnecessary. Simply do this, and...

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:29.580
You could match me when you were in an AT.

00:14:29.580 --> 00:14:33.630
But a true warrior must win
in all forms of combat!

00:14:33.630 --> 00:14:35.130
Do you understand, Chirico?

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.080
What's wrong, Chirico?
Are you a warrior or not?

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.960
Yes, get angry! Be arrogant!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.960
Learn to hate me!

00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.630
Son of a...!

00:15:09.460 --> 00:15:11.540
I cannot lose to you.

00:15:11.540 --> 00:15:13.920
I am one of the chosen.

00:15:13.920 --> 00:15:15.880
I am a Perfect Soldier!

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:18.960
Is that all, Chirico, the former Red Shoulder?

00:15:19.420 --> 00:15:20.460
Damn you...

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.580
Ypsilon, wait!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:51.670
I'll make the kill.

00:16:47.420 --> 00:16:48.670
He isn't dead.

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:52.420
It's my mistake I didn't kill him with one blow.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:55.130
But I can't kill an enemy who can't fight back!

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:59.080
Your pride won't let you?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.920
Take him to the dungeon!

00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:03.500
He dies tomorrow morning!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:08.960
What do you want at this hour?

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:12.080
Urgent orders from Prince Kanjelman.

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:14.500
He wants to question the prisoner.

00:18:14.500 --> 00:18:16.080
Open the cell.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:19.790
But Mr. Ypsilon said not to let
anyone see him till the execution.

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:21.170
Open it!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.630
Chirico, hurry!

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.210
Chirico...

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:05.540
Fyana...

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.540
Chirico... I wanted to call out to you.

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:12.000
Even though your coming to see me again
meant having this happen...

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.170
I'm glad you're here.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:20.210
Run away with me.
We'll get jijirium, somehow.

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:21.880
No.

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:26.420
As long as I'm a Perfect Soldier,
no matter where I run, it'll just be the same.

00:19:26.420 --> 00:19:28.880
Chirico, save yourself.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:30.920
If you stay behind, they'll kill you.

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:32.880
I don't care about me.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:34.750
I just want you to live.

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.080
Fyana...

00:19:36.580 --> 00:19:38.670
Hurry. This way.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:00.960
Hurry, Chirico!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:02.170
Fyana! Get in!

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:04.330
Who's there?

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:15.040
Chirico, hurry!

00:20:24.710 --> 00:20:27.040
Get in one! I'll cover you! Hurry!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.290
Fyana!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.130
Get inside one!

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.580
Fyana!

00:21:38.250 --> 00:21:39.580
Over there!

00:22:02.210 --> 00:22:04.210
Use my boat.

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.920
I'm just paying you back. Now move it!

00:22:11.710 --> 00:22:12.880
Thank you.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:19.290
And tell Potaria something for me.

00:22:19.290 --> 00:22:22.750
I haven't forgotten the time
we shared as children.

00:22:24.460 --> 00:22:25.670
I understand.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:41.540
Fyana hadn't forgotten me.

00:22:43.210 --> 00:22:46.960
Knowing that was good enough for me.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.790
Next Episode

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.000
Change. Change. Change.

00:22:58.460 --> 00:23:03.000
The huge beast which encircles the world
begins to stir in Hades' depths.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:05.830
The Heavens moan. Men cry out.

00:23:06.080 --> 00:23:08.540
The stage is reset with a change in the wind.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:13.130
Past, present, and future
are hidden in gunsmoke.

00:23:13.710 --> 00:23:18.500
Which is why the only unbreakable bond
is the belief in love.

00:23:18.920 --> 00:23:20.920
Next time, "Turnabout"

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:24.290
Turnabout

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:23.380
Is there any love that cannot be changed?

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Whenever I'm feeling lonely

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Whenever I'm feeling sad

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
I can always see you floating in my mind

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Whenever I'm alone

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Whenever I long for you

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
I can always feel you inside my heart

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
No matter how far apart we may go

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
No matter if my path should part from yours

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
The memories of you seem to shine inside my heart...

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Brighter than any other light...
